---
// Canonical alias route for /trending
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/trending" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://aio-ai.dev/trending" />
  <title>Redirecting to GitHub Trending | AIO AI</title>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen font-sans">
  <div class="text-center space-y-3">
    <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs text-white shadow-md">AI</div>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Redirecting to GitHub Trending...</p>
    <a href="/trending" class="text-xs text-blue-400 underline font-mono">Click here if not redirected</a>
  </div>
  <script is:inline>
    window.location.replace('/trending');
  </script>
</body>
</html>
